for slice(r10) -> L1 else L2 stages [L1, L3, L4, L5]
// L1: free {take}
// L3: cycle Carried(r12) in_order {call max}
// L4: free {take, -}
// L5: cycle Carried(r13) any_order law(Call(#2, identity) exact commutative) {call max}
// control upfront
// cost W=7 O=18293 split when n > 83626, n = len(r10)
